    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Ironbound Ascendants</strong></p><p><strong>“Height is not terrain. It is policy.”</strong></p><p>Ironbound Ascendants make strongholds out of bad footing and turn cliffs into arguments. They understand supply lines, choke valleys, and the spiritual value of making your enemies climb tired. If a mountain matters, they intend to own the meaning of it.</p><p><em>You’ve learned the first law of altitude: the hill fights for whoever arrives prepared.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Athletics and Athletics.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> In Mountains and Highlands, travel is more efficient for your faction and elevation penalties are easier to manage.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
